<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>was it all for nothing?</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Savage Ga$p, 8percent, Shady Moon</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">forever yours</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2Z9KNKlCiMPB3dSvKxXoHe</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.290" end="00:02.410">Do you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.410" end="00:09.230">Reminiscin' 'bout us?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.230" end="00:11.430">Do you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.430" end="00:16.410">Reminiscin' 'bout us?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.410" end="00:18.140">Tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.140" end="00:20.480">Is it the end of the world?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.480" end="00:21.980">Or the end of our world?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.950" end="00:23.680">I just wanna let you know right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.680" end="00:26.740">If it all falls down, you gonna still be my</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.740" end="00:29.650">Girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.650" end="00:31.150">Or my friend or somethin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.950" end="00:32.840">How'd forever fade into never?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.840" end="00:35.610">How did somethin' turn into nothin'? Like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.610" end="00:38.340">Why you gettin' so defensive?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.340" end="00:39.840">You can stop pretendin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.610" end="00:41.700">Have you ever felt truly happy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.700" end="00:44.370">Say you're happier when you with him, but</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.370" end="00:46.490">Winter time cold without you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.490" end="00:48.500">You on go, I can't go without you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.500" end="00:50.520">Words you say would cut through my soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.520" end="00:53.720">Now I'm a ghost in a shell and I know it haunts you like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.720" end="00:55.840">So tell me somethin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.840" end="00:57.750">Did it all mean nothin'?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.750" end="00:59.430">But do you ever sit and wonder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.430" end="01:02.560">Like, "Was it real or were we just fuckin'?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.560" end="01:04.840">I been sippin' somethin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.840" end="01:06.690">But I still feel nothin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.690" end="01:08.270">So many, "I love you's"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.270" end="01:11.080">But you make me question if I know what love is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.080" end="01:13.570">Do you feel the same?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.570" end="01:18.350">Reminiscin' 'bout us?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.350" end="01:20.140">Tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.140" end="01:22.220">Do you feel the same?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.220" end="01:27.990">Or was it for nothin'?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.990" end="01:30.870">I just spent way too many nights wondering how you feel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.870" end="01:32.940">And now I could really give a fuck, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.940" end="01:34.760">You betrayed my trust, I thought this was love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.760" end="01:36.880">But you broke my heart, I'm like "What the fuck?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.880" end="01:38.850">Back in my room, slow dancing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.850" end="01:41.030">Now when I call you don't answer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.030" end="01:43.870">Gave you my heart and you held it for ransom</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.870" end="01:45.560">But fuck it, I'm taking my chances</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.560" end="01:47.640">I risk it all for you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.640" end="01:49.930">What else can he offer you, baby?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.930" end="01:52.360">Now that you gone, all I got is this song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.360" end="01:54.430">Please can I song for you, baby?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.430" end="01:56.500">Hooks I may sing for you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.500" end="01:58.830">Might get a ring for you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.830" end="02:00.950">And on the real, no matter what</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.950" end="02:04.350">I'll do anything for you, baby, so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.350" end="02:06.870">So tell me somethin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.870" end="02:08.660">Did it all mean nothin'?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.660" end="02:10.160">But do you ever sit and wonder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.090" end="02:13.770">Like, "Was it real or were we just fuckin'?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.770" end="02:15.670">I been sippin' something</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.670" end="02:17.640">But I still feel nothin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.640" end="02:19.140">So many, "I love you's"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.100" end="02:22.210">But you make me question if I know what love is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.210" end="02:24.410">Do you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.410" end="02:29.390">Reminiscin' 'bout us?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.390" end="02:30.990">Tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.990" end="02:33.040">Do you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.040" end="02:38.360">Or was it for nothin'?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.360" end="02:39.860" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Fuck you, Shady)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.220" end="02:41.960">Does your heart still race when I call your phone?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.960" end="02:43.820">Girl, and if not, I get it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.820" end="02:45.900">I wanna be friends, but I know it won't work</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.900" end="02:47.440">'Cause I still feel the same about you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.440" end="02:49.640">You say let's dead it, you say move on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.640" end="02:52.330">I wish I could tell you how I feel without the words in this song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.330" end="02:54.460">'Cause the big deals don't mean shit to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.460" end="02:56.680">And now I'm gettin' big deals to see it through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.680" end="02:59.240">Could have gave me all your love and pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.240" end="03:04.380">I took it in for your smile, babe, whoa (whoa)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.380" end="03:08.190">And I can't wait for your heart in vein</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.190" end="03:12.180">You cause me too much distress, babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.180" end="03:14.890">Now, you got me wondering</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.890" end="03:17.390">Do you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.390" end="03:24.020">Reminiscin' 'bout us?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.020" end="03:26.560">Do you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:26.560" end="03:30.560">Reminiscin' 'bout us?</p></div></body></tt>